Package: hullBase
Title: Adaptive, Concave-Aware Rubberband Baseline Correction
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Thanya", "Manivannan", email = "thanyamanivannan@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides an automatic, concave-aware extension of the classic
    rubberband (convex hull) method for baseline correction of spectra such
    as Fourier-transform infrared (FTIR) data. Standard rubberband baselines
    cannot represent concave regions of the true background. This package
    detects concave hull segments automatically and refines them using
    thresholds derived from each spectrum's own noise level, removing the
    need for user-supplied tuning parameters.
